&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;About the Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Careem is building the Everything App for the greater Middle East, making it easier than ever to move around, order food and groceries, manage payments, and more. Careem is led by a powerful purpose to simplify and improve the lives of people and build an awesome organisation that inspires. Since 2012, Careem has created earnings for over 2.5 million Captains, simplified the lives of over 70 million customers, and built a platform for the region&#39;s best talent to thrive and for entrepreneurs to scale their businesses. Careem operates in over 70 cities across 10 countries, from Morocco to Pakistan.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;About The Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Careem Groceries team is transforming the way people shop for everyday essentials by offering a fast, reliable, and seamless Q-commerce experience. Within this fast-paced environment, the Category Management team is responsible for building the right assortment, pricing, and promotions that delight customers while driving business growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create new items selected by CM &amp;amp; CE and ensuring high quality content meeting the guidelines and standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with SC when required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collect the required info from the suppliers to complete the creation of new or relisted items&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take care of the suppliers requests to update the items info in oracle in timely manner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pick the internal feedback, verify it and proceed with the correction if required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pick tags updates based on SC &amp;amp; Suppliers feedback for stock availability matters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent checks on items content and mapping in the categories&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quarterly full master data audits to improve the content quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;What you&#39;ll need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education : Any Undergraduate/Postgraduate. Business background is needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience 1-2 years of experience in catalog management, business development, or account management .&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Careem is building the Everything App for the greater Middle East — making it easy to move around, order food and groceries, manage payments, and more. Our purpose is simple: to simplify and improve people’s lives and build an awesome organisation that inspires.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Since 2012, Careem has enabled earnings for over 2.5 million Captains, simplified the lives of more than 70 million customers, and built a platform where the region’s best talent and entrepreneurs thrive. We operate in 70+ cities across 10 countries, from Morocco to Pakistan.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;We’re now entering our next chapter — one powered by AI. We’re looking for AI talent: curious problem-solvers who know how to apply AI to build tools, automate workflows, and create real impact. Whether it’s streamlining operations, enhancing customer experience, or reimagining internal systems — we want people who can make Careem work smarter and move faster.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Careem Ads is redefining how brands connect with consumers across the region&#39;s leading super-app ecosystem. We&#39;re hiring an Agency Partnerships Lead to drive agency adoption of Careem Ads and build the agency-led commercialization model across the UAE, KSA, and Egypt turning agency relationships into a structured, multi-million dollar revenue channel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What You&#39;ll Lead&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;1. Set the Agency GTM Strategy for the Region&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and own the UAE, KSA and Egypt GTM strategy across the Big 6 holding groups including annual JBPs, reseller models, and multi-market expansion plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and evangelize Careem Ads&#39; value proposition - equip agencies with the narrative, data, and proof points to pitch Careem Ads confidently to clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage strategic relationships with agency leadership and own a defined agency revenue pipeline target&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Lead &amp;amp; Mentor the Agency Partnerships Function&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and develop a growing team of Agency Partner Managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive excellence in pipeline planning, forecasting, relationship mapping, and quarterly business reviews (QBRs)Establish the operating rhythm, success metrics, and governance for the function (e.g. pipeline coverage, solution adoption goals, roadshows, JBP attainment)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. Drive Enterprise-Level Revenue Growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence Careem Ads&#39; revenue plan for non-endemic businesses by scaling agency-led buying unlocking multimillion-dollar contributions through structured partnerships, playbooks, and new channel expansion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver revenue directly across your agency portfolio and identify untapped growth opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to shaping our scalable sales enablement material and run agency roadshows&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4. Shape Product + Market Fit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead strategic feedback to Product, Measurement, Creative Ops, and Finance - guiding prioritization of formats, measurement solutions, and reporting needs for agencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive agency demand for new innovation and beta pilots&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;5. Be a Foundational Builder&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a core member of the founding team building Careem Ads&#39; infrastructure, playbooks, brand narrative, and GTM&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Careem Ads to build market presence and credibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12-15+ years in media sales, digital advertising, or agency partnerships (across tech), with a proven track record of building and scaling agency ecosystems and exceeding revenue targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills - comfortable using data and tools (Excel/BI) to build forecasts and defend commercial plansWorking knowledge of the competitive media landscape particularly digital (Meta, Google, TikTok, Snap, Amazone) and retail media&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive presence: capable of influencing senior stakeholders including C-suite across agencies and large advertisers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English and Arabic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial, strategic thinker comfortable in ambiguous, 0-to-1 environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with non-endemic categories &amp;amp; brand advertising ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating AI tools into workflows (forecasting, reporting, campaign operations) to drive efficiency gains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or scaling a partnership function from scratch, not just operating within an existing one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why This Role Matters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will architect the agency ecosystem for Careem Ads, shaping the operating model as the business scales across a multi-market regionYour impact will be measurable and tied directly to Careem Ads&#39; revenue growth&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
